      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "现在是星期天中午。大星五十分钟没看我了。",
      "traditional": "現在是星期天中午。大星五十分鐘沒看我了。",
      "pinyin": "xiàn zài shì xīng qī tiān zhōng wǔ dà xīng wǔ shí fēn zhōng méi kàn wǒ le",
      "english": "It was midday on a Sunday. Daxing hadn’t looked at me for 50 minutes."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他吃饭，他和他的猫玩，但是他不看我！我身体热了十分钟，但是没有人知道。",
      "traditional": "他吃飯，他和他的貓玩，但是他不看我！我身體熱了十分鐘，但是沒有人知道。",
      "pinyin": "tā chī fàn tā hé tā de māo wán dàn shì tā bú kàn wǒ wǒ shēn tǐ rè le shí fēn zhōng dàn shì méi yǒu rén zhī dào",
      "english": "He ate, he played with his cat, but he didn’t look at me! My body had been hot for ten minutes, but no one knew."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我看了十分钟电影，但是没有人听见。我要怎么做？我要怎么做？",
      "traditional": "我看了十分鐘電影，但是沒有人聽見。我要怎麼做？我要怎麼做？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ kàn le shí fēn zhōng diàn yǐng dàn shì méi yǒu rén tīng jiàn wǒ yào zěn me zuò wǒ yào zěn me zuò",
      "english": "I watched a movie for ten minutes, but no one heard it. What should I do? What should I do? "
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "昨天茶茶说“人要听手机的”，我要怎么做？大星可以听我的？",
      "traditional": "昨天茶茶說“人要聽手機的”，我要怎麼做？大星可以聽我的？",
      "pinyin": "zuó tiān chá chá shuō rén yào tīng shǒu jī de wǒ yào zěn me zuò dà xīng kě yǐ tīng wǒ de",
      "english": "Yesterday Chacha said that “people must listen to phones”. What should I do? Could Daxing listen to me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“小米，你怎么了？”苹果说。",
      "traditional": "“小米，你怎麼了？”蘋果說。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo mǐ nǐ zěn me le píng guǒ shuō",
      "english": "“Xiaomi, what’s the matter with you?” said Apple. "
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "是苹果手机，他来了，他和大星的妈妈来了。",
      "traditional": "是蘋果手機，他來了，他和大星的媽媽來了。",
      "pinyin": "shì píng guǒ shǒu jī tā lái le tā hé dà xīng de mā ma lái le",
      "english": "It was the Apple phone. He was here. He and Daxing’s mom were here."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "我和苹果手机一起看电影，他们会听见吗？",
      "traditional": "我和蘋果手機一起看電影，他們會聽見嗎？",
      "pinyin": "wǒ hé píng guǒ shǒu jī yì qǐ kàn diàn yǐng tā men huì tīng jiàn ma",
      "english": "If I watched a movie with the Apple phone, would they hear it?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    }
