      "What Should I Do?",
      "",
      "It was midday on a Sunday. Daxing hadn’t looked at me for 50 minutes.",
      "",
      "He ate, he played with his cat, but he didn’t look at me! My body had been hot for ten minutes, but no one knew.",
      "I watched a movie for ten minutes, but no one heard it. What should I do? What should I do? ",
      "Yesterday Chacha said that “people must listen to phones”. What should I do? Could Daxing listen to me?",
